## [v0.6.9]

### What's New

- Recording has been introduced
    - Recording overlay can be toggled on/off
    - Instant Replay can still be used while recording
- Playback timer introduced inside clip preview
    - 0.25x -> 2.00x
- Master Volume is now included in the Audio Mixer
- Audio sources now start their slider at 50%, letting you increase the volume if needed
- Instant Replay length increased to 10 min
- Favorties section moved to the tab list
    - Mark as Favorite changed to the Star icon
- Your Clips can now be viewed in List and Tile

### Bugfixes

- Trim timeline properly disappears when the mouse is not active in the frame

